<rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>tree6316mte – 행위(Behavioral) 패턴</title><link>https://tree6316mte.github.io/design_pattern/behavioral_patterns/</link><description>Recent content in 행위(Behavioral) 패턴 on tree6316mte</description><generator>Hugo -- gohugo.io</generator><language>ko</language><atom:link href="https://tree6316mte.github.io/design_pattern/behavioral_patterns/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>옵저버</title><link>https://tree6316mte.github.io/design_pattern/behavioral_patterns/observer/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://tree6316mte.github.io/design_pattern/behavioral_patterns/observer/</guid><description>
&lt;div class="hx-overflow-x-auto hx-mt-6 hx-flex hx-rounded-lg hx-border hx-py-2 ltr:hx-pr-4 rtl:hx-pl-4 contrast-more:hx-border-current contrast-more:dark:hx-border-current hx-border-red-200 hx-bg-red-100 hx-text-red-900 dark:hx-border-red-200/30 dark:hx-bg-red-900/30 dark:hx-text-red-200"&gt;
&lt;div class="ltr:hx-pl-3 ltr:hx-pr-2 rtl:hx-pr-3 rtl:hx-pl-2"&gt;&lt;div class="hx-select-none hx-text-xl" style="font-family: 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', 'Segoe UI Symbol';"&gt;🚫&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class="hx-w-full hx-min-w-0 hx-leading-7"&gt;
&lt;div class="hx-mt-6 hx-leading-7 first:hx-mt-0"&gt;(작성중) 아직 작성되지 않은 포스트 글입니다.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;옵저버(Observer) 패턴이란?&lt;span class="hx-absolute -hx-mt-20" id="옵저버observer-패턴이란"&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;a href="#%ec%98%b5%ec%a0%80%eb%b2%84observer-%ed%8c%a8%ed%84%b4%ec%9d%b4%eb%9e%80" class="subheading-anchor" aria-label="Permalink for this section"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://tree6316mte.github.io/images/design_pattern/behavioral_patterns/observer.png" alt="" loading="lazy" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div style="text-align: center; color: gray; font-size: 0.9em; margin-bottom: 20px;"&gt;유투브 채널(Subject)를 구독(Subscribe)하여 영상이 올라오면 사용자(Observer)가 알림을 받는다&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;옵저버(Observer) 패턴&lt;/strong&gt;은 어떤 객체의 상태가 변할 때, 그 객체에 의존하는 다른 객체들에게 자동으로 알림이 가고 업데이트되도록 하는 &lt;strong&gt;행위(Behavioral)&lt;/strong&gt; 디자인 패턴입니다.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;쉽게 말해, &lt;span style="color:#87CEEB;"&gt;&amp;ldquo;유튜브 채널(주체)을 구독(Subscribe)하면, 새로운 영상이 올라왔을 때 구독자(옵저버)들에게 알림이 가는 시스템&amp;rdquo;&lt;/span&gt;입니다. 게임에서는 플레이어의 체력이 깎였을 때, 체력 바 UI, 피격 사운드, 업적 시스템 등이 플레이어를 &amp;lsquo;관찰&amp;rsquo;하고 있다가 동시에 각자의 역할을 수행하도록 만들 때 가장 많이 사용됩니다.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;구성 요소&lt;span class="hx-absolute -hx-mt-20" id="구성-요소"&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;a href="#%ea%b5%ac%ec%84%b1-%ec%9a%94%ec%86%8c" class="subheading-anchor" aria-label="Permalink for this section"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;이 패턴은 크게 2가지 핵심 요소로 구성됩니다.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Subject (주체, 관찰 대상)&lt;/strong&gt;: 상태를 가지고 있으며, 상태가 변하면 등록된 관찰자들에게 알림(Notify)을 보냅니다. (유튜버)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Observer (관찰자, 구독자)&lt;/strong&gt;: Subject의 상태 변화를 감지하고 알림을 받아 특정 행동을 수행하는 객체입니다. (구독자)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;옵저버 패턴 적용 예시&lt;span class="hx-absolute -hx-mt-20" id="옵저버-패턴-적용-예시"&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;a href="#%ec%98%b5%ec%a0%80%eb%b2%84-%ed%8c%a8%ed%84%b4-%ec%a0%81%ec%9a%a9-%ec%98%88%ec%8b%9c" class="subheading-anchor" aria-label="Permalink for this section"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;플레이어가 사망했을 때 게임 오버 UI를 띄우고, 효과음을 재생하고, 업적을 달성해야 하는 상황을 가정해 보겠습니다.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span style="color:#F08080;"&gt;옵저버 패턴이 없는 코드 (강한 결합)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="hx-absolute -hx-mt-20" id="옵저버-패턴이-없는-코드-강한-결합"&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;a href="#%ec%98%b5%ec%a0%80%eb%b2%84-%ed%8c%a8%ed%84%b4%ec%9d%b4-%ec%97%86%eb%8a%94-%ec%bd%94%eb%93%9c-%ea%b0%95%ed%95%9c-%ea%b2%b0%ed%95%a9" class="subheading-anchor" aria-label="Permalink for this section"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;div class="hextra-code-block hx-relative hx-mt-6 first:hx-mt-0 hx-group/code"&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code class="language-csharp" data-lang="csharp"&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="k"&gt;using&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nn"&gt;UnityEngine&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="kd"&gt;public&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="k"&gt;class&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nc"&gt;Player&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="n"&gt;MonoBehaviour&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;{&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="c1"&gt;// 플레이어가 알아야 할 다른 시스템들이 너무 많습니다!&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="kd"&gt;public&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="n"&gt;UIManager&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="n"&gt;uiManager&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="kd"&gt;public&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="n"&gt;SoundManager&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="n"&gt;soundManager&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="kd"&gt;public&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="n"&gt;AchievementManager&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="n"&gt;achievementManager&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="kd"&gt;public&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="k"&gt;void&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="n"&gt;Die&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;()&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;{&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="n"&gt;Debug&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt;Log&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s"&gt;&amp;#34;플레이어 사망!&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;);&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="c1"&gt;// 플레이어가 다른 클래스들의 메서드를 직접 호출해야 합니다.&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="n"&gt;uiManager&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt;ShowGameOverUI&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;();&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="n"&gt;soundManager&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt;PlayDeathSound&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;();&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="n"&gt;achievementManager&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt;UnlockDeathAchievement&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;();&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;}&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;}&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="hextra-code-copy-btn-container hx-opacity-0 hx-transition group-hover/code:hx-opacity-100 hx-flex hx-gap-1 hx-absolute hx-m-[11px] hx-right-0 hx-top-0"&gt;
&lt;button
class="hextra-code-copy-btn hx-group/copybtn hx-transition-all active:hx-opacity-50 hx-bg-primary-700/5 hx-border hx-border-black/5 hx-text-gray-600 hover:hx-text-gray-900 hx-rounded-md hx-p-1.5 dark:hx-bg-primary-300/10 dark:hx-border-white/10 dark:hx-text-gray-400 dark:hover:hx-text-gray-50"
title="Copy code"
&gt;
&lt;div class="copy-icon group-[.copied]/copybtn:hx-hidden hx-pointer-events-none hx-h-4 hx-w-4"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class="success-icon hx-hidden group-[.copied]/copybtn:hx-block hx-pointer-events-none hx-h-4 hx-w-4"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/button&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;위 코드의 문제는 Player가 UIManager, SoundManager 등 &lt;strong&gt;자신과 상관없는 시스템들을 너무 많이 알고 있어야 한다&lt;/strong&gt;는 것입니다. 만약 퀘스트 시스템이 추가되어서 플레이어 사망 시 퀘스트 실패 처리를 해야 한다면? Player 코드를 또 수정해야 합니다. 코드가 얽히고설키는 스파게티 코드가 되기 쉽습니다.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;이제 옵저버 패턴을 적용하여 플레이어는 자기 할 일(사망)만 하고, 나머지 시스템들은 알아서 반응하도록 분리해 보겠습니다.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span style="color:#87CEEB;"&gt;옵저버 패턴을 통한 해결 코드 (C# event 활용)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="hx-absolute -hx-mt-20" id="옵저버-패턴을-통한-해결-코드-c-event-활용"&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;a href="#%ec%98%b5%ec%a0%80%eb%b2%84-%ed%8c%a8%ed%84%b4%ec%9d%84-%ed%86%b5%ed%95%9c-%ed%95%b4%ea%b2%b0-%ec%bd%94%eb%93%9c-c-event-%ed%99%9c%ec%9a%a9" class="subheading-anchor" aria-label="Permalink for this section"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;C#과 Unity에서는 복잡한 인터페이스를 만들 필요 없이, 기본 제공되는 delegate나 event (또는 Action)를 사용하면 옵저버 패턴을 아주 완벽하고 쉽게 구현할 수 있습니다.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="hextra-code-block hx-relative hx-mt-6 first:hx-mt-0 hx-group/code"&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code class="language-csharp" data-lang="csharp"&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="k"&gt;using&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nn"&gt;System&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="k"&gt;using&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nn"&gt;UnityEngine&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="c1"&gt;// 1. Subject (관찰 대상 = 플레이어)&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="kd"&gt;public&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="k"&gt;class&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nc"&gt;Player&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="n"&gt;MonoBehaviour&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;{&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="c1"&gt;// 이벤트(알림 방송국) 생성&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="c1"&gt;// 누군가 이 이벤트를 구독하면, 플레이어가 죽을 때 알려줍니다.&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="kd"&gt;public&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="k"&gt;event&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="n"&gt;Action&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="n"&gt;OnPlayerDeath&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="kd"&gt;public&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="k"&gt;void&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="n"&gt;Die&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;()&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;{&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="n"&gt;Debug&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt;Log&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s"&gt;&amp;#34;플레이어 사망!&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;);&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="c1"&gt;// 이벤트에 구독자(Observer)가 있다면 모두에게 알림 발송!&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="k"&gt;if&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt;OnPlayerDeath&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;!=&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="kc"&gt;null&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;{&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="n"&gt;OnPlayerDeath&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt;Invoke&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;();&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;}&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;}&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;}&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="c1"&gt;// 2. Observer (관찰자 = UI 시스템)&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="kd"&gt;public&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="k"&gt;class&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nc"&gt;UIManager&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="n"&gt;MonoBehaviour&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;{&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="kd"&gt;public&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="n"&gt;Player&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="n"&gt;player&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="k"&gt;void&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="n"&gt;Start&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;()&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;{&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="c1"&gt;// 플레이어의 사망 이벤트에 &amp;#39;구독&amp;#39; 신청 (+ 기호 사용)&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="n"&gt;player&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt;OnPlayerDeath&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;+=&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="n"&gt;ShowGameOverUI&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;}&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="k"&gt;void&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="n"&gt;ShowGameOverUI&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;()&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;{&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="n"&gt;Debug&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt;Log&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s"&gt;&amp;#34;UI: 게임 오버 화면 출력&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;);&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;}&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;}&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="c1"&gt;// 3. Observer (관찰자 = 사운드 시스템)&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="kd"&gt;public&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="k"&gt;class&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nc"&gt;SoundManager&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="n"&gt;MonoBehaviour&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;{&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="kd"&gt;public&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="n"&gt;Player&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="n"&gt;player&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="k"&gt;void&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="n"&gt;Start&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;()&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;{&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="c1"&gt;// 플레이어의 사망 이벤트에 &amp;#39;구독&amp;#39; 신청&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="n"&gt;player&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt;OnPlayerDeath&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;+=&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="n"&gt;PlayDeathSound&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;}&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="k"&gt;void&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="n"&gt;PlayDeathSound&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;()&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;{&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="n"&gt;Debug&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt;Log&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s"&gt;&amp;#34;Sound: 으악! 사망 효과음 재생&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;);&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;}&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;}&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="hextra-code-copy-btn-container hx-opacity-0 hx-transition group-hover/code:hx-opacity-100 hx-flex hx-gap-1 hx-absolute hx-m-[11px] hx-right-0 hx-top-0"&gt;
&lt;button
class="hextra-code-copy-btn hx-group/copybtn hx-transition-all active:hx-opacity-50 hx-bg-primary-700/5 hx-border hx-border-black/5 hx-text-gray-600 hover:hx-text-gray-900 hx-rounded-md hx-p-1.5 dark:hx-bg-primary-300/10 dark:hx-border-white/10 dark:hx-text-gray-400 dark:hover:hx-text-gray-50"
title="Copy code"
&gt;
&lt;div class="copy-icon group-[.copied]/copybtn:hx-hidden hx-pointer-events-none hx-h-4 hx-w-4"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class="success-icon hx-hidden group-[.copied]/copybtn:hx-block hx-pointer-events-none hx-h-4 hx-w-4"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/button&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;이제 Player 클래스에는 UI나 Sound와 관련된 코드가 단 한 줄도 없습니다! 새로운 시스템이 추가되어도 Player 코드는 전혀 수정할 필요 없이, 새로운 시스템이 Player의 이벤트를 구독(+=)하기만 하면 됩니다.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;장점과 단점&lt;span class="hx-absolute -hx-mt-20" id="장점과-단점"&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;a href="#%ec%9e%a5%ec%a0%90%ea%b3%bc-%eb%8b%a8%ec%a0%90" class="subheading-anchor" aria-label="Permalink for this section"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;h3&gt;장점&lt;span class="hx-absolute -hx-mt-20" id="장점"&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;a href="#%ec%9e%a5%ec%a0%90" class="subheading-anchor" aria-label="Permalink for this section"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;느슨한 결합 (Loose Coupling)&lt;/strong&gt;: 상태를 변경하는 객체(Subject)와 반응하는 객체(Observer)가 서로를 몰라도 잘 작동합니다. 의존성이 크게 줄어듭니다.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;개방-폐쇄 원칙 (OCP)&lt;/strong&gt;: 새로운 관찰자를 추가할 때 기존 코드를 수정할 필요가 없습니다. 확장에 매우 유연합니다.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;단점&lt;span class="hx-absolute -hx-mt-20" id="단점"&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;a href="#%eb%8b%a8%ec%a0%90" class="subheading-anchor" aria-label="Permalink for this section"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;메모리 누수 위험&lt;/strong&gt;: 관찰자(Observer) 객체가 파괴될 때 구독을 해지(-=)하지 않으면, 백그라운드에 좀비처럼 남아 메모리 누수를 일으킬 수 있습니다.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;실행 순서 보장 불가&lt;/strong&gt;: 알림을 받는 관찰자들 사이의 실행 순서를 무조건적으로 보장하거나 예측하기 어렵습니다.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;전체 요약&lt;span class="hx-absolute -hx-mt-20" id="전체-요약"&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;a href="#%ec%a0%84%ec%b2%b4-%ec%9a%94%ec%95%bd" class="subheading-anchor" aria-label="Permalink for this section"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;div class="hx-overflow-x-auto hx-mt-6 hx-flex hx-rounded-lg hx-border hx-py-2 ltr:hx-pr-4 rtl:hx-pl-4 contrast-more:hx-border-current contrast-more:dark:hx-border-current hx-border-orange-100 hx-bg-orange-50 hx-text-orange-800 dark:hx-border-orange-400/30 dark:hx-bg-orange-400/20 dark:hx-text-orange-300"&gt;
&lt;div class="ltr:hx-pl-3 ltr:hx-pr-2 rtl:hx-pr-3 rtl:hx-pl-2"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class="hx-w-full hx-min-w-0 hx-leading-7"&gt;
&lt;div class="hx-mt-6 hx-leading-7 first:hx-mt-0"&gt;&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;객체 간의 상태 변화를 &amp;lsquo;구독&amp;rsquo;하고 &amp;lsquo;알림&amp;rsquo;을 받는 구조를 만들 때 사용합니다.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Unity에서는 C#의 event와 Action을 사용하면 인터페이스 없이도 매우 쉽고 강력한 옵저버 패턴을 구현할 수 있습니다!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;</description></item><item><title>전략</title><link>https://tree6316mte.github.io/design_pattern/behavioral_patterns/strategy/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://tree6316mte.github.io/design_pattern/behavioral_patterns/strategy/</guid><description>
&lt;h2&gt;전략(Strategy) 패턴이란?&lt;span class="hx-absolute -hx-mt-20" id="전략strategy-패턴이란"&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;a href="#%ec%a0%84%eb%9e%b5strategy-%ed%8c%a8%ed%84%b4%ec%9d%b4%eb%9e%80" class="subheading-anchor" aria-label="Permalink for this section"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://tree6316mte.github.io/images/design_pattern/behavioral_patterns/strategy.png" alt="" loading="lazy" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div style="text-align: center; color: gray; font-size: 0.9em; margin-bottom: 20px;"&gt;어떤 포탄을 선택할까? 각양각색의 포탄 종류&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;전략(Strategy) 패턴&lt;/strong&gt;은 실행 중에 알고리즘(전략)을 선택할 수 있게 하는 &lt;strong&gt;행위(Behavioral)&lt;/strong&gt; 디자인 패턴입니다.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;쉽게 말해, &lt;span style="color:#87CEEB;"&gt;&amp;ldquo;어떤 일을 수행하는 방법(전략)들을 캡슐화하여, 필요할 때마다 동적으로 교체해서 사용할 수 있게 해주는 것&amp;rdquo;&lt;/span&gt;입니다. 게임에서 무기를 바꿀 때마다 공격 방식(예: 포탄의 종류)이 달라지는 상황을 떠올리면 가장 이해하기 쉽습니다.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;구성 요소&lt;span class="hx-absolute -hx-mt-20" id="구성-요소"&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;a href="#%ea%b5%ac%ec%84%b1-%ec%9a%94%ec%86%8c" class="subheading-anchor" aria-label="Permalink for this section"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;이 패턴은 크게 3가지 요소로 구성됩니다.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategy (전략 인터페이스)&lt;/strong&gt;: 모든 전략들이 공통으로 가져야 할 메서드를 정의합니다. (예: &lt;code&gt;interface&lt;/code&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Concrete Strategy (구체적인 전략)&lt;/strong&gt;: 전략 인터페이스를 실제로 구현한 클래스들입니다. (예: &lt;code&gt;interface&lt;/code&gt;를 상속받은 &lt;code&gt;class&lt;/code&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Context (컨텍스트)&lt;/strong&gt;: 전략 객체를 가지고 있으며, 필요할 때 전략 객체의 메서드를 호출해서 사용합니다. (예: &lt;code&gt;interface&lt;/code&gt;를 멤버변수로 사용할 &lt;code&gt;class&lt;/code&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;전략 패턴 적용 예시&lt;span class="hx-absolute -hx-mt-20" id="전략-패턴-적용-예시"&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;a href="#%ec%a0%84%eb%9e%b5-%ed%8c%a8%ed%84%b4-%ec%a0%81%ec%9a%a9-%ec%98%88%ec%8b%9c" class="subheading-anchor" aria-label="Permalink for this section"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;전략 패턴이 없는 코드와 전략 패턴을 적용한 코드를 만들어 비교해 보겠습니다.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span style="color:#F08080;"&gt;전략 패턴이 필요한 코드&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="hx-absolute -hx-mt-20" id="전략-패턴이-필요한-코드"&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;a href="#%ec%a0%84%eb%9e%b5-%ed%8c%a8%ed%84%b4%ec%9d%b4-%ed%95%84%ec%9a%94%ed%95%9c-%ec%bd%94%eb%93%9c" class="subheading-anchor" aria-label="Permalink for this section"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;div class="hextra-code-block hx-relative hx-mt-6 first:hx-mt-0 hx-group/code"&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code class="language-csharp" data-lang="csharp"&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="k"&gt;using&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nn"&gt;UnityEngine&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="c1"&gt;// 고폭탄, 철갑탄, 날탄&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="kd"&gt;public&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="kd"&gt;enum&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="n"&gt;BulletType&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;{&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="n"&gt;HighExplosive&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;,&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="n"&gt;ArmorPiercing&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;,&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="n"&gt;Sabot&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;}&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="kd"&gt;public&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="k"&gt;class&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nc"&gt;Tank&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;{&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="kd"&gt;public&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="n"&gt;BulletType&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="n"&gt;myBullet&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="n"&gt;BulletType&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt;HighExplosive&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="kd"&gt;public&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="k"&gt;void&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="n"&gt;SetBullet&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt;BulletType&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="n"&gt;bullet&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;{&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="n"&gt;myBullet&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="n"&gt;bullet&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;}&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="kd"&gt;public&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="k"&gt;void&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="n"&gt;Fire&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;()&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;{&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="c1"&gt;// 무기 종류가 추가될 때마다 switch문이 무한정 길어지게 됩니다.&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="k"&gt;switch&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt;myBullet&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;{&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="k"&gt;case&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="n"&gt;BulletType&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt;HighExplosive&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt;
